            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Bug reports now carry a compact one-line capture diagnostic (output route, whether the other side&#x27;s audio track came up silent, which transcription path ran), so a report alone is enough to pinpoint issues like a 2-person call that transcribed as one speaker — no back-and-forth needed.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
