        <item>
            <title>0.14.96</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 19:54:41 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>157</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.96</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>The recording HUD equalizer no longer flickers / disappears repeatedly during a recording. A burst of window-occlusion events (Space switches, a full-screen call app coming forward) was momentarily pausing the animation and freezing the bars; those events are now smoothed so the equalizer stays steady. This completes the flicker fix started in 0.14.95.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
